    "# Assignment 2: Model to Web Application\n",
    "\n",
    "## AI Spreadsheets and Python Programming\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business Problem\n",
    "The objective is to develop a multiple linear regression model to predict **Monthly Units Sold** for a product using product, pricing, advertising, competition, store coverage, customer rating, inventory availability, product category, and brand tier.\n",
    "\n",
    "The final validated preprocessing + regression pipeline will later be saved as `model.pkl` and integrated into a Streamlit web application.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Project Objectives\n",
    "1. Understand and prepare the dataset.\n",
    "2. Perform data-quality checks and exploratory data analysis.\n",
    "3. Diagnose the assumptions of multiple linear regression.\n",
    "4. Apply justified corrective measures.\n",
    "5. Re-fit and re-check the regression model.\n",
    "6. Evaluate model performance.\n",
    "7. Interpret important predictors from a business perspective.\n",
    "8. Save the final model pipeline for deployment.\n"
   ]
  },
