   "source": [
    "### Corrective Action Decision\n",
    "\n",
    "For this AISPP dataset, the baseline diagnostics indicate two important model-specification issues:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Unit_Price and Competitor_Price are extremely highly correlated**, producing high VIF values. `Competitor_Price` is therefore removed to reduce redundant information while retaining the directly controllable `Unit_Price` variable.\n",
    "2. **Heteroscedasticity and right-skewness are evident in the baseline model.** A log1p transformation is applied to the positive numerical predictors and to the target. The transformed-target pipeline automatically converts predictions back to the original units.\n",
    "3. Potential outliers and influential observations are investigated but are not automatically deleted because they may represent legitimate product-level business behavior. Only confirmed data-quality errors should be removed.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "08041147",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 10. Corrective Measures and Re-fitting\n",
    "\n",
    "The corrected model removes `Competitor_Price`, log-transforms the numerical predictors using `log1p`, and models `log1p(Monthly_Units_Sold)`. The complete preprocessing and regression workflow remains inside one pipeline."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 52,
   "id": "b875f862",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Corrected feature sets\n",
    "final_features = [\n",
    "    \"Product_Category\",\n",
    "    \"Brand_Tier\",\n",
    "    \"Unit_Price\",\n",
    "    \"Discount_Percentage\",\n",
    "    \"Advertising_Spend\",\n",
    "    \"Store_Coverage_Count\",\n",
    "    \"Customer_Rating\",\n",
    "    \"Inventory_Availability_Percentage\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "final_numeric_features = [\n",
    "    \"Unit_Price\",\n",
    "    \"Discount_Percentage\",\n",
    "    \"Advertising_Spend\",\n",
    "    \"Store_Coverage_Count\",\n",
    "    \"Customer_Rating\",\n",
    "    \"Inventory_Availability_Percentage\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "final_categorical_features = [\n",
    "    \"Product_Category\",\n",
    "    \"Brand_Tier\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "X_train_final = X_train[final_features].copy()\n",
    "X_test_final = X_test[final_features].copy()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 53,
   "id": "3cae2cd7",
