   "source": [
    "## 11. Final Business Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "The final regression model predicts `Monthly_Units_Sold` using product category, brand tier, pricing, discounting, advertising spend, store coverage, customer rating, and inventory availability.\n",
    "\n",
    "The final model uses a log-log specification for numerical predictors and the target. This makes numerical coefficients interpretable approximately as elasticities, while categorical coefficients represent differences relative to reference categories.\n",
    "\n",
    "Permutation importance is used as a complementary predictive-importance measure. The testing metrics are used to assess generalization to unseen observations.\n",
    "\n",
    "The final model is now ready to be saved as a single preprocessing + regression pipeline and later loaded by the web application."
   ]
